# ~/.config/athenos/deploy.env on Joel's Mac (template
# infra/beta/env/deploy.env.example). Read by deploy.sh, rollback.sh and
# model-upload.sh. No secrets: SSH uses your key/agent, gh its own login.

# SSH destination (an alias from ~/.ssh/config is best).
DEPLOY_HOST=athenos-beta
# Upload directory on the server (writable by the SSH user).
DEPLOY_UPLOAD_ROOT=/var/tmp/athenos-upload

# GitHub repositories of the components (for `deploy.sh <tag>`).
REPO_FENRIR=J03lF/fenrir
REPO_ATHENOS=fenrir-modules/athenos
REPO_ATHENOS_API=fenrir-modules/athenos-api
REPO_AUTH_SERVICE=fenrir-modules/auth-service
REPO_NOTIFICATION_SERVICE=fenrir-modules/notification-service
REPO_ATHENOS_WEB=fenrir-modules/athenos-web

# Per-component tag override, when not every repo has the same tag:
#TAG_AUTH_SERVICE=v0.1.3
